Licensing for tools/
=====================

The tools in this directory are NOT all under the same license. See the
repository-root LICENSE for the authoritative map.

Apache License, Version 2.0 - see ../LICENSE-APACHE

  - validator/              the reference conformance validator
  - doc-snippet-validate/   validates the YAML examples inside the docs

  Free to use, modify and redistribute, including in commercial and proprietary
  products. Conformance belongs with the format: a schema whose only complete
  definition is a tool you cannot freely run is not an open format.

Functional Source License 1.1 (ALv2 Future License) - see ../LICENSE-FSL

  - model-builder/          the model graph, and the relation vocabulary typing it
  - semantic-checker/       model-quality rules, and the adapter feeding them

  Free for any Permitted Purpose (internal use, non-commercial education and
  research, and professional services you provide to others). NOT for a
  Competing Use. Each version converts to Apache-2.0 two years after release.

  The rule ENGINE is not in this directory and is not covered here: it is the
  separate Apache-2.0 package @archally/semantic-checker. What is licensed above
  is the realm rule set and the adapter - the opinions, not the machinery.
